    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2355ec1496679bbe9dd28d9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这里，我希望能进行一个仪式。\n——骑士授任仪式（Accolade）。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72e65668097014cc05b330edc66b1ce2b8ae1ccad288650ea84a1e21f48cad25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
