      "uid": "zhcn:c7097bc570e8caa8ae01cff4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。通过这个仪式，我将成为您的专属骑士。\n训练员殿下，请您为我主持仪式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ae1bc53604fc9f74c8b501b3230a8c2b62139b0f5b07d51826abe7ca4bcd66c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1121/storytimeline_041121004.json",
