      "uid": "zhcn:39cb944435d9aa00f6290171",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——胜利、荣耀、欢喜。愿你作为赛马娘，\n履行一切使命，成为众人的守护者",
      "source_fingerprint": "008264073fac23cba5d0d61d3d18a559a447c542002c9e29115f517258073ce9",
